  "remarks": "Ilya Scherbovich is the founder and head of United Capital Partners Investment Group, a large Russian financial investment group, with investments in oil and gas production and processing. In particular, along with Russian State oil company Rosneft, United Capital Partners Investment Group holds a significant part in an Indian company operating an oil refinery and subject to Union restrictive measures. This company is a major refiner of Russian crude oil. The energy sector, in particular the oil sector, is a sector providing a substantial source of revenue to the Russian Government.",
